"Leaf Hua Li","x":"We're now lifting our guidance to 280,000 net new paying clients this year, which translates to 141% year-on-year growth in our total number of paying clients. [Foreign Speech] Besides total paying clients, we also witnessed robust growth momentum in total client assets and stable client retention.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/13/futu-holdings-limited-futu-q2-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"FUTU 2020 Q3","e":"futu","d":"2020-11-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Yuan","x":"…a rough ideas if we migrate all these existing positions to our self-clearing house today, the cost savings in terms of the execution fee and also the idle cash potentially we can monetize alongside with the stock positions we can potentially monetize through stock borrowing and lending…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/19/futu-holdings-limited-futu-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"FUTU 2020 Q4","e":"futu","d":"2021-03-16","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Leaf Li","x":"We have established partnerships with 39 asset managers around the world, which altogether hosted 39 live-streaming on our platform in 2020 to conduct fund publicity and investor education.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/16/futu-holdings-limited-futu-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"FUTU 2022 Q2","e":"futu","d":"2022-08-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Arthur Chen","x":"…increase in brokerage commission and handling charge income, the expenses declined due to the cost savings from our U.S. sales -- U.S. securities self-clearing migration and upgraded service package with our U.S. clearinghouse and the lower IPO subscription fees. The Q-over-Q decrease was…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/30/futu-holdings-ltd-futu-q2-2022-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"FUTU 2025 Q2","e":"futu","d":"2025-08-20","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Arthur Chen","x":"The year over year and the quarter over quarter increase was mainly driven by greater investments in AI capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/20/futu-futu-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FUTU 2025 Q2","e":"futu","d":"2025-08-20","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Daniel Yuan","x":"We've also launched Moomoo AI, including AI chatbox, AI-powered stock investment tools, and lots of technical charts and stock-related fundamental data.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/20/futu-futu-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FUTU 2025 Q2","e":"futu","d":"2025-08-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Arthur Chen","x":"So we continue to optimize our US-related trading capabilities to streamline that investing experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/20/futu-futu-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FUTU 2025 Q3","e":"futu","d":"2025-11-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Arthur Chen","x":"The year-over-year and the quarter-over-quarter increase was mainly driven by our greater investment in crypto and AI capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/18/futu-futu-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FUTU 2025 Q3","e":"futu","d":"2025-11-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Arthur Chen","x":"Internally, we will further utilize our AI capabilities to streamline our business process and enhance our operating efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/18/futu-futu-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FUTU 2025 Q4","e":"futu","d":"2026-03-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Daniel Yuan","x":"On the internal fund, we strengthened Airstar Bank's compliance and risk management capabilities by developing an anti-money laundering system and AI-powered fraud detection infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/futu-futu-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c